 "description": "<p><a href=\"http://www.dmi.dk/groenland/vejret/byvejr/by/vis/GL/4231/Kangerlussuaq,%20Gr%C3%B8nland/\">Weather forecast</a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.dmi.dk/groenland/arkiver/vejrarkiv/\">Weather archive</a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.dmi.dk/uploads/pics/klima_kangerlussuaq.png\">Climate</a></p><p>DMI operates a meteorological office in Nuuk, Greenland. This office serves aviation in Greenland including all Greenlandic Airports and support to SAR-operations. The office is the Meteorologcial Watch Office for Greenlandic Airspace and serves flight operations all over Greenland and to Off-shore installations and scientific camps in the area.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Meteorologcal Office Nuuk is manned on a 24 hour basis with meteorologists certified according to WMO - ICAO education and training requirements.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
